      "writtenOn": "2023-05-19T13:51:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should avoid using globs due to them being error-prone and can bring in more things than we need. Can this just be a list of files?\n\nIf we *must* use globs, please add allow_empty\u003dFalse so if there\u0027s a typo in the glob and it matches nothing, Bazel treats that as an error.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 56,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 56,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "b3eb176b2623f10cee80256f1729ddab1bfe15e1",
